{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Grow Up! - A Worm Game</u> is about a worm-like creature from space, trying to find their way in the vast world, can you guide them and help them... Grow Big? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a truly unique form of character movement / control, requiring both mouse and keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The easy to learn, hard to master gameplay, will keep you <strong>coming</strong> back for more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several worlds, each filled with unique puzzles, gimmicks and challenges, your braincells will surely be stimulated!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels require light puzzle-solving, technical precision, and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're fast, you could earn copper, silver or even gold medals!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the high skill ceiling and a focus on speed, you can brag about your time achievements to other people!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1888640?t=1761661108","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1888640?t=1761661108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761661108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761661108","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Grow Up! - A Worm Game</u> is about a worm-like creature from space, trying to find their way in the vast world, can you guide them and help them... Grow Big? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a truly unique form of character movement / control, requiring both mouse and keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The easy to learn, hard to master gameplay, will keep you <strong>coming</strong> back for more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several worlds, each filled with unique puzzles, gimmicks and challenges, your braincells will surely be stimulated!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels require light puzzle-solving, technical precision, and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're fast, you could earn copper, silver or even gold medals!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the high skill ceiling and a focus on speed, you can brag about your time achievements to other people!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Govknar Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888640/header.jpg?t=1761661108","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1888640/613371/4ba880f3185846b261ce7e38e46372479052ab8a/1751045204/dash_av1.mpd?t=1696201993","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1888640/613371/4ba880f3185846b261ce7e38e46372479052ab8a/1751045204/dash_h264.mpd?t=1696201993","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1888640/613371/4ba880f3185846b261ce7e38e46372479052ab8a/1751045204/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1696201993","id":256